description:
Increases the damage done by your Tamed Pet by $s1%, and Tamed Beast special attacks by an additional $s2%.

Reduces the cooldown of Intimidation by $/1000;S3 sec.

@ext:Tamed Pet includes Summoned Demon, Enslave Demon, Dominate Undead, Tame Dragonkin or Tether Elemental, and Tame Beast.:ext@
